[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":2},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i75"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦？这里是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有既四……不对，既视感。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"时间上来说是早上，但屋里和窗外都很昏暗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这幅景象我已经再熟悉不过了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“又是梦吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明是在做梦却有意识，而且还能反应过来是在做梦。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这叫清醒梦来着吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是不是说明我睡得很浅呢？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11561"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“盯――――――……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哇？镜子阿姨？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11582"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“盯――――――……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"镜子阿姨正直勾勾地盯着我看。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11547"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“呵呵呵。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而且她的眼神饱含热情，似乎有话要说。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，难道是要整理仓库？终于轮到我帮忙了吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11550"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“不是哦，我只是在看你的睡脸。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11620"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“觉得好可爱呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哈啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“您说什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11597"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“呵呵呵呵。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11600"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“不过，你睡醒的时候也很帅气，我也很喜欢呢～”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“请冷静一下，我可是您的外甥啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11620"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“哎呀，就是这种酷酷的感觉最让人心动了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总感觉情况有点不妙。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11582"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“今天呀，我还特意给你做了呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“做了什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11576"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“爱妻便当♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"原来如此――是这么回事啊――……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这次的梦，是上次反过来的版本――"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11550"},{"op":"text","speaker":"镜子","text":"“啊，要我帮你换衣服吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不！不、不用了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过这样的话，这次的梦……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接下来会发生的是――……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"正如我预料的那样，外面变得嘈杂起来。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i30"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一边应付着镜子阿姨，一边简单穿上件衣服走到外面。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"果不其然，出现在那里的是早有预料的几个人――……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12075"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“天善，你这种人没资格出场。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15166"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“这话应该是我说才对。就凭你这种货色也想出头，还早一百万年呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"……――但他们的样子比预想中还要夸张。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一大早就这么瘆人。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12083"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“喔，羽依里！你看着！我现在就要把这个自以为是的乒乓球笨蛋打倒！”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15173"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“鹰原，有你看着我的话，胜利就已经是囊中之物了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊――……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"完全不知道该说什么好。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人A","text":"“不愧是排名靠前的，气场就是不一样啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“说明他们是动真格的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人B","text":"“虽说是为了小羽，但我们也做不到那个地步。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"老奶奶","text":"“要是老夫年轻个六十岁，也就能用风韵把他迷倒啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"排名……这么一说上次的梦里，我可是野美希心中排名第一位的啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那么也就是说……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15175"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12124"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“赶紧给我把排名第三的宝座让出来吧――――――！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15186"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“名为鹰原的领奖台！绝不会让你这种人登上去！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"光着身子的男人们开始交锋。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"用的并不是拳头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而是飞身跃起，以裸露的胸膛砰砰砰地互相激情碰撞。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"每撞一下都会让汗水四溅。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真的是太瘆人了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过既然天善是排名第三，那再上面的第一和第二位是……"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10241"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“哈啊～看看这群杂鱼，在为排名争得你死我活呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“出现了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12077"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“苍!!你这个排名第二的家伙！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15167"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“你这个用多余的脂肪来勾引鹰原的毒妇！”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10330"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你说多余？就是因为很有效果，我才能排第二的吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10325"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“下等人说什么都只是败犬的哀嚎罢了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i10394"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“羽依里教我的筷子用法，真的很管用呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以说，我到底赋予了筷子什么可能性啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过这下可算明白了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果之前的梦算是野美希的争夺战，那这次就是争夺我的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那么，现在的第一名应该是……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然，周围嚷嚷了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的大人A","text":"“第一名大人光临了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"家庭主妇B","text":"“那位大人，今天终于能得到鹰原大人的宠幸了吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来是野美希来了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13059"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……咦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白……羽？第一名莫非是鸣濑白羽吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到白羽，良一和天善、苍都不由得咽了口唾沫。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13069"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"image","layer":515,"image":"i18121"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i218"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13095"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“死开。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":515},{"op":"clear","layer":768},{"op":"clear","layer":1024},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i30"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12131"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15183"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“咕哈啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10138"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“咿呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仅仅一句话，三个人就被击飞了。物理上真的被击飞了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这就是排名第一的实力吗？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13059"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白、白羽……就是目前和我走得最近的人吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13065"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“怎么可能。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13062"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我把路清出来了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽说完，从她身后悄然出现了一个人影。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12427"},{"op":"text","speaker":"凶恶老人","text":"“嗯，辛苦了，白羽。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是谁؟!”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12416"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“我乃与鹰原羽依里最亲近之人，鸣濑小鸠。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“初、初次见面……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"来者是一个气势汹汹的老人，他好像是白羽的外公。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不对，为什么又要半裸着啊！而且排名第一的怎么是个男的啊！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然看起来确实很强就是了！"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12419"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“小子，今天就请赐予我主人的宠爱吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12417"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"他径直地……向我走来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“做不到……我真的做不到……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12447"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“来吧，小子，来吧！来吧!!”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11757"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“真让人看不下去啊，鸣濑老头子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12422"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小鸠","text":"“唔！美、美希大人……！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11758"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哎？啊！野美希！我还以为排名第一的是你呢……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11777"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“排名？哦，好像确实有过这种制度。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11771"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不过，我早就脱离那玩意的控制了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“野美希……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"环顾四周，发现所有人都跪了下来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"无论是良一天善还是岛上的人们，就连看起来那么强的白羽外公也都跪在了地上。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11761"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“说说看我是谁。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12064"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“是！您是野村美希大人！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11758"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不够！”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i15167"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“是鹰原羽依里的正室！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11750"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“很好！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“正、正室؟!”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11691"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“没错哦，亲爱的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11729"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“排名什么的根本无关紧要。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11697"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我才是你唯一的挚爱。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，哦、哦……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11830"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“那么，我们走吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"野美希说完，岛民们便退到路边列好了队。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个……去哪里？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11832"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“当然是去我家了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11835"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“――在等着呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊，又来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我没太听清野美希的声音。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，视野逐渐被光芒染成了白色。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]